p>Complete the rules in the grammar box with these words.<\/p>"},"parts":["<p><b>Grammar | Present continuous<\/b><\/p><p>We use the present continuous to describe actions happening <sup>1<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_4\"><\/gap>.<\/p><p>\u2022 To form the present continuous affirmative, use the present simple form of <sup>2<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_5\"><\/gap> + verb + <sup>3<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_6\"><\/gap>:<\/p><p><em>I<\/em><b><em>\u2019m<\/em><\/b><em> (I <\/em><b><em>am<\/em><\/b><em>) <\/em><b><em>visiting<\/em><\/b><em> the Repair Caf\u00e9.<\/em><\/p><p>\u2022 To form the present continuous negative, add <sup>4<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_7\"><\/gap> (or <em>n\u2019t<\/em>) after be:<\/p><p><em>They <\/em><b><em>aren\u2019t<\/em><\/b><em> (<\/em><b><em>are not<\/em><\/b><em>) listening to music.<\/em><\/p><p>\u2022 To form questions, put <em>am<\/em>, <em>is<\/em> or <sup>5<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_8\"><\/gap> before the subject:<\/p><p><em>What <\/em><b><em>is<\/em><\/b><em> she <\/em><b><em>doing<\/em><\/b><em>?<\/em><\/p><p>\u2022 To form short answers, use <em>Yes<\/em> or <em>No<\/em> + subject + present simple form of be:<\/p><p><em>Is he fixing his bike?<\/em><\/p><p><b><em>Yes, he is.<\/em><\/b><em> \/ <\/em><b><em>No, he isn\u2019t<\/em><\/b><em>.<\/em><\/p>"],"configs":[{"correctAnswer":"now","additionalAnswers":[],"id":"gap_4","type":"gap","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_2\/p24_ex1ab\/"},{"correctAnswer":"be","additionalAnswers":[],"id":"gap_5","type":"gap","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_2\/p24_ex1ab\/"},{"correctAnswer":"-ing","additionalAnswers":[],"id":"gap_6","type":"gap","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_2\/p24_ex1ab\/"},{"correctAnswer":"not","additionalAnswers":[],"id":"gap_7","type":"gap","exerciseUrl":"https:\/\/exercise-editor.helbling.com\/files\/potential_a2\/SB\/unit_2\/p24_ex1ab\/"},{"correctAnswer":